    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Epite ŋolo epukator Esekia Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋiuni ipukat Osea lokoku ke Ela Isirael, kisyak Esekia lokoku ka Aas akipuka Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikaru keŋ ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikan apaki ŋina esyakinia akipuka Yudaya. Kipuka iŋes Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikanikaomwon. Arae ekiro a toto keŋ Abi nakoku a Sakariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyae iŋes ŋuna etalakarito Ekapolon lopite jik ŋolo etiyaa papaa keŋ Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes tobwaŋabwaŋaiya neni elipeneneere ŋakujo ka ŋipirin. Touko daŋ epir ŋolo etaletoi. Tari emun ŋolo etiyaunitae a eburonis ŋolo koloŋ ewuakini Moses nen, abu iŋes tobilibili, anerae ariŋa Ŋisirael emuroete neni ke emun a ŋol akitodol apaki ŋin. Anyaritae ekiro ke emun aŋol Neusutan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekinyomit Esekia Ekapolon Akuj ŋina a Ŋisirael, amam ice ŋini ekwaanatar iŋes alokidiŋ ŋirwosi a Yudaya daadaŋ ŋulu epukato ekaku keŋ, kori daŋ aneni a ŋulu epukato eriŋa iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emiidikina iŋes neni ke Ekapolon; pa aesyanakini iŋes akiwuapit acamit ŋina ke Ekapolon, nai ericit ŋakiciketa ŋuna abu Ekapolon kicikak Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arukito Ekapolon ka iŋes. Ŋuna daadaŋ abu kitiya, abu kitiya ejok nooi. Abu Esekia toŋer erwosit ŋolo ka Asiriya towou daŋ akitiyanakin iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Esekia kitiji Ŋipilistin ameun alotaunio a ŋulu cicik tari ŋulu apolok akitodol lotaun Gasa ka akwap ŋina edunyatar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋiomwon ipukat Esekia Yudaya, torae ŋikaru ka Osea a lokoku ke Ela ŋikanikaarei ipukat Isirael, abu Salimaneser erwosit ka Asiriya torem akwap kirikau Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani elunyarosi ŋikaru ŋiuni ŋulu erikaunitere Samaria, aponi kikamarae. Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋikanikapei ipukat Esekia Yudaya, torae ŋolo ekaru ŋolo a ŋikanikaomwon ipukat Osea Isirael, aponi kikamarae Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikama erwosit ŋolo ka Asiriya Ŋisirael torik ya Asiriya. Abu kitolomu ikes ŋice lotaun ŋolo enyaritae Ala, ŋice diyete aŋolol Abor, anakwap a Gosan ka ŋice lotaunio a Media. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyakinosi ŋakiro ŋun, anerae apotu Ŋisirael towout akiirar ŋakiro ke Ekapolon Akuj kec. Toŋero akiwap acamunet keŋ. Ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna aris Moses eketiyan ŋolo ke Ekapolon kicikak ikes, apotu ikes towout akiirar, kori akiwuap.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Torem Senakerib Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋitomon ka ŋiomwon ipukat Esekia, abu Senakerib erwosit ka Asiriya torem ŋitaunio alo Yudaya daadaŋ ŋulu adukuk ejok, kikama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Esekia kiyakiya akirot neni a Senakerib a ŋolo ayai lotaun Lakis tema, “Adyakarit ayoŋ. Ekelipit iyoŋ toboŋo nyikirem ayoŋ. Edaŋidaŋi ayoŋ etacit daadaŋ ŋolo ca ikitubokini iyoŋ ayoŋ.” Abu erwosit ka Asiriya totubok Esekia alemun ŋitalantae ŋamiae ŋauni ŋulu ke esilipa ka ŋitalantae ŋatomoniuni ŋulu ke egolid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inak Esekia iŋes esilipa daadaŋ ŋolo alo Kai ka Akuj ka ŋolo ayai kai ke erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Esekia apaki ŋin kibeibeu egolid ŋolo enaminamitae lokekia ŋulu ka Akai ka Akuj ka daŋ ŋolo ayai lopirin ŋulu aya lokekia, egolid ŋolo sek arae Esekia pei enaminami nen, tosodi kipoto inak erwosit ka Asiriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiya erwosit ŋolo ka Asiriya neni ke Esekia a ŋolo ayai Yerusalem ŋikapolok ŋulu a ŋasigarya keŋ ŋiuni, ŋolo apolokinit daadaŋ ka ŋolo ewuapit ŋol ta ŋolo apol alojie. Arukito ikes ka ŋasigarya ŋuna alalak nooi ŋuna arukorete ka ikes alotaun Lakis. Potu ikes tari Yerusalem, towua anadoketa aŋuna ka abwal a ŋina ayai neni amukur, lorukude ŋolo alosi neni adonyere ŋilowi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋasigarya ka Asiriya tonyarata Esekia erwosit, tolomut kiŋa neni aya ŋasigarya ka Asiriya, Eliakim lokoku a Ilikia ŋolo apolokinit etic alokai ke erwosit ka Sebina ŋolo arae ekegirigiran ta Yoa lokoku ka Asap ŋolo arae ekeŋadan ŋakiro ŋuna adaun akigir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekapolokiniton ejie a ŋasigarya ka Asiriya tolimok ikes alimokin Esekia erwosit ŋakiro nu: “Ebala erwosit ŋolo arwon ŋolo ka Asiriya, tolimo ibore ŋini ituror iyoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibala iyoŋ ayenikinit epite ŋolo ejiere ka ayakar agogoŋu nai irworo iyoŋ akidiŋ koŋin. Neni a ŋae imecakinit iyoŋ tokona ikiŋeritor ayoŋ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiira! Imecakinit iyoŋ neni ka akwap a Ijipit a ŋina ikwaan ka akasirimaete ŋina igitar torem ituŋanan akan ebala ecogekinia! Ŋulu emecakinito neni a Parao, icogekinito ikes akasirimaete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani nabo kitemasi iyes ayoŋ imecakinito iyes neni ke Ekapolon Akuj kus, meere mono ŋakiboisyo ŋuna eya nenimukur ka ŋamuroeta keŋ abu Esekia tobwaŋabwaŋa a? Pa abu iŋes kicikak ŋituŋa a Yudaya ka Yerusalem akilipenen a Namuroet a ŋina eyai Yerusalem a? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tokona, ani kiraakasi ŋikilyok, potu kirworo ka ka ekapolon kaŋ erwosit ka Asiriya. Akainakini ayoŋ iyes ŋaŋolei ŋalipyo ŋaarei erae kipedorete aryamun ŋikametok kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kerae neni ka akwap a Ijipit imecakinito iyes aŋuna ka ainakin iyes ŋagaari ŋuna iritae a ŋaŋolei ka ŋasigarya ŋuna emeto ŋaŋolei, alipite ipedoryata iyes areun ekarikon ŋasigarya tari ŋolo erae epei todit apolou keŋ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo daŋ, nyabunit ayoŋ amunaar akwap na aŋuna kaŋ bon pa akalimokinit Ekapolon. Ekapolon Akuj iŋes pei abu ekecikak ayoŋ abunore akirem ka amunyar akwap na.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
